animsound_negative:
Changes direction of influence of the sound value.
animation = parameter_value / (1 + multiplication_factor * sound) - (addition_factor * sound);
Note: multiplication_factor scales the denominator in this function.

limits_enabled:
Enables rendering of fractal cross sections.
Example cross sections of Buffalo fractal:
x = {-10; 10}, y = {-10, 10}, z = {-10, 0}
x = {-10, 0}, y = {0, 10}, z = {-0.1; 0.1}
